    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the popular and conveniently located development of Windtown Park, Rathowen, No. 2 is an attractive three-bedroom mid-terraced home extending to approximately 109 sq. m. The property has been well maintained and has recently been fully repainted throughout, with new carpets and flooring laid in the bedrooms, creating a fresh and welcoming interior ready for immediate occupation.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out over two floors. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, comfortable sitting room, spacious kitchen/dining area and guest WC. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from its own ensuite, together with a main family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking to the rear and a private, low-maintenance garden, providing an ideal outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nNo. 2 Windtown Park represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize or investors seeking a well-presented property in a convenient Westmeath location. Rathowen offers a range of local amenities while providing easy access to surrounding towns and the wider road network.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the presentation, accommodation and location this property has to offer.\n\n\nBER : B \nBER No.: 119735702\n\nServices : Main water/sewerage"
      },
